From: Nex Distribution <nex@example.invalid>
Subject: podman: search administrator, runtime, and vendor configuration
Source: https://github.com/containers/podman/archive/refs/tags/v5.4.1.tar.gz
Upstream: Not submitted; this implements the UAPI configuration directory order.

Keep containers.conf merge behavior and add the runtime tier between vendor
and administrator files. Select one registries.conf and policy.json with
administrator, runtime, then vendor priority. Merge registries.conf.d files in
the reverse read order so higher tiers replace lower values. Preserve user and
explicit path behavior. Exercise the vendored libraries with their real
parsers.

